| **Pyth SOL/USD Feed (Devnet)** | `H6AR6H2wY6jEGV7a7ssi9b8mw7VAj68Jz6T8mxy95G32` |
| **Pyth BTC/USD Feed (Devnet)** | `HovQMDrbAgAYPCmHVSrezcSmkMtXSSUsLDFANExrZh2J` |
