│                                                         │
│  ⚡ Atomic Execution: ON    Gas: ~$4.20                  │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │           [ Find Best Route → ]                    │ │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 3.2 Route discovery and comparison view

After the user clicks "Find Best Route", the system queries all aggregators in parallel and
presents a multi-route comparison:

```text
