its for 19,584 two-asset plus 235,008 three-asset small-domain burns; A 272-burn zero-reserve-leg edge sweep also passes for partial in-kind exits; all-state backing and SPL CPI reconciliation remain open. S5B core-math evidence may be independently accepted over documented parameterized domains without selecting production values; final precision, weight-floor, fee, quote-band, seed-tolerance and oracle/risk policy decisions remain with S5A. S5E remains blocked until the final accepted S5A contract/policy freeze incorporates accepted S5B math evidence, S5C oracle/risk decisions and S5D2 fee/economics decisions. Integrated ETF SBF compute and actual SPL CPI custody/share reconciliation are S5E obligations because the program must exist before they can be measured. A separate reproducible 1,944-row three-asset near-`u64` tiny-input corpus now covers three reserve shapes, 12 ordered weight profiles, all six swap directions, three input sizes and three fee values; it checks exact fee-adjusted and gross-custody bounds separately, including zero-net fail-closed cases. A 2,160-row 9,999-bps boundary corpus crosses the gross-input transitions at net 0/1/2 across five reserve shapes, including successful asymmetric quotes; the 10,000-bps fee remains rejected. A new 37,800-vector exact-integer corpus covers every three-asset reserve triple from 4 to 8, 12 selected weight profiles, all ordered pairs and every custody-valid input at fees 0/30/5,000 bps; it distinguishes 18,000 zero-net and 11,085 dust rejections from successful and output-cap cases. A separate 144-case regression accepts the exact 30% input-cap floor and rejects the next unit across all selected profiles and directions. S5C's direct SDK-backed Devnet reads confirm the expected Receiver account layout/feed IDs and `Full` verification; a replayable confirmed-slot capture at `509720001` records exact genesis/account/block-time RPC envelopes and replays offline through the pinned Rust SDK. All three feeds were 129