  <div class="eyebrow">Issue 38 / Native Android / Design study</div>
  <h1>Your mix.<br>A vault that keeps moving.</h1>
  <p>A focused mobile journey for the Solana hackathon: connect, own a portfolio, and let scheduled execution maintain its allocation. The Kotlin app uses MWA; this HTML is only a screen study.</p>
